<h1>Sports Learning Platform - React Concepts Documentation</h1>
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Total Marks: 50</strong></p>

<hr>

<h2>1. About the Use Case</h2>
<p>
The scenario focuses on a child with Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD). The user wants to learn sports concepts but struggles with traditional text-heavy instructions, requiring a visually driven approach. The child logs into the "Sports Learning Platform" and selects a sport module. After watching a simplified tutorial, the user takes the "Quiz" which presents visual questions. The system provides immediate feedback with gentle animations. The user earns points which are added to the Leaderboard, motivating the child to continue learning through interactive play.
</p>

<hr>

